WEBVTT

01:40.690 --> 01:44.210
[A Moment But Forever]

01:45.039 --> 01:47.150
[Episode 29]

01:55.430 --> 01:56.229
Are you okay?

01:56.479 --> 01:57.280
Yes.

01:58.430 --> 01:59.430
Here you go.

01:59.840 --> 02:01.000
Thank you, uncle.

02:01.400 --> 02:03.870
My father said something big is happening in the city today.

02:03.890 --> 02:05.650
No one is allowed to play on the streets.

02:07.350 --> 02:08.470
You should hurry home then.

02:08.910 --> 02:10.100
You should go home too.

02:26.360 --> 02:28.360
Zhi Dai, we should get going.

02:55.360 --> 02:56.560
Young Mistress Dai, please stop.

03:08.200 --> 03:09.000
Young City Lord.

03:13.760 --> 03:14.710
What's going on?

03:22.190 --> 03:23.000
Dai.

03:32.470 --> 03:33.280
Father.

03:35.870 --> 03:37.150
Your daughter has returned.

03:51.060 --> 03:52.810
I left home recklessly at a young age.

03:54.030 --> 03:55.680
I used to think that

03:55.680 --> 03:57.079
the most important thing in life

03:57.630 --> 03:58.940
was to pursue

03:59.150 --> 04:00.330
what you like,

04:01.520 --> 04:02.800
to be free and unrestrained,

04:02.870 --> 04:04.080
and to dare to dream and act.

04:04.750 --> 04:06.260
Only then would I not let myself down.

04:07.700 --> 04:09.230
But I was wrong.

04:11.080 --> 04:12.710
Not only did I waste time,

04:14.120 --> 04:14.910
but I also failed

04:14.910 --> 04:16.480
to repay my parents' kindness in raising me.

04:16.500 --> 04:20.220
[In Memory of Beloved Father, the Late Lord of Yandu City, Zhi Gong]

04:18.390 --> 04:19.829
Over these past years,

04:20.560 --> 04:22.630
I've considered myself dead.

04:23.830 --> 04:25.240
I even once hoped

04:25.720 --> 04:27.190
that you would consider me dead as well.

04:28.720 --> 04:29.830
Only in this way

04:30.120 --> 04:31.830
could I have a slightly clear conscience.

04:33.330 --> 04:34.970
Until I met Shen Ying again,

04:35.310 --> 04:36.560
I didn't realize that you, Father,

04:36.560 --> 04:38.070
had been thinking of me all along,

04:38.830 --> 04:40.960
and had even been sending people to protect me in secret.

04:42.390 --> 04:43.190
I...

04:47.830 --> 04:49.430
I'm truly ashamed of myself.

05:05.600 --> 05:06.390
Father.

05:07.070 --> 05:08.750
Zhi Yue established the Wushuang Society in private

05:08.810 --> 05:10.130
and colluded with War Demons

05:10.430 --> 05:11.480
to intentionally provoke a war

05:11.480 --> 05:13.240
between the human race and the Youhu Clan.

05:13.660 --> 05:14.740
I discovered it in time,

05:14.830 --> 05:16.270
but I failed to inform you

05:16.450 --> 05:18.420
because I hoped he would tell you himself.

05:19.600 --> 05:21.190
Unexpectedly, his ambition was like that of a wolf,

05:21.630 --> 05:23.950
disregarding your father-son relationship entirely,

05:24.160 --> 05:25.430
and he actually committed such a beastly act

05:25.450 --> 05:27.280
of patricide and usurpation.

05:28.190 --> 05:28.990
Today,

05:29.800 --> 05:31.480
I must put righteousness before family ties

05:32.210 --> 05:33.860
and purge my own family.

06:02.110 --> 06:02.990
Gentleman.

06:07.270 --> 06:09.000
Are you looking for someone?

06:09.600 --> 06:10.390
No.

06:11.310 --> 06:12.480
I'm waiting for someone.

06:13.160 --> 06:15.000
Waiting? Who are you waiting for?

06:15.480 --> 06:16.270
You.

06:16.750 --> 06:17.550
You're waiting for me?

06:39.050 --> 06:41.409
The ones who killed Father are you

06:41.830 --> 06:43.240
and the Youhu Clan,

06:43.270 --> 06:44.270
not me!

06:44.290 --> 06:45.810
Will you atone for your crimes by taking your own life,

06:46.030 --> 06:47.680
or do I have to do it myself?

06:47.750 --> 06:50.020
The Youhu Clan is the real culprit!

06:50.470 --> 06:52.230
The only reason they were willing to accept you

06:52.310 --> 06:54.120
was to use you,

06:54.159 --> 06:56.240
to kill Father through you,

06:56.890 --> 06:57.690
thereby sowing

06:58.000 --> 06:59.190
discord between us,

06:59.360 --> 07:01.170
making us turn against each other,

07:01.960 --> 07:03.570
and leaving our race leaderless

07:03.600 --> 07:04.800
and in disarray.

07:05.000 --> 07:05.800
They did this

07:05.840 --> 07:07.570
to annex the human race,

07:07.600 --> 07:08.390
Dai!

07:10.950 --> 07:12.920
Let me call you Elder Sister one last time.

07:13.800 --> 07:15.800
If you still care about Father

07:16.720 --> 07:17.990
and the human race in your heart,

07:18.830 --> 07:20.310
wake up a bit.

07:21.390 --> 07:24.430
Stop doing stupid things that please your enemies

07:24.970 --> 07:27.240
and hurt those who care about you.

07:27.480 --> 07:29.040
Go explain to Father yourself.

07:36.310 --> 07:38.190
I've already lost my father.

07:39.070 --> 07:41.040
I don't want to lose my elder sister too.

07:42.159 --> 07:43.870
Don't push me anymore!

07:51.630 --> 07:52.430
Take action!

07:52.640 --> 07:53.950
It looks like

07:54.220 --> 07:55.580
it's quite lively here.

08:03.400 --> 08:04.700
[Qingqi Hall]

08:03.940 --> 08:05.570
Zhi Dai, are you alright?

08:16.190 --> 08:17.720
High Priest Yuanzhong.

08:18.360 --> 08:19.870
You plan to use her

08:20.000 --> 08:22.160
to scheme for my family's assets in Yandu.

08:22.210 --> 08:24.420
Have you asked for the consent

08:24.610 --> 08:26.090
of everyone present?

08:26.240 --> 08:27.750
What do you mean by that, Young City Lord?

08:29.130 --> 08:30.690
Zhi Dai left home at a young age.

08:30.980 --> 08:33.059
The only person I've relied on since childhood was my father.

08:33.240 --> 08:34.270
But for the prosperity

08:34.320 --> 08:35.750
of the human race,

08:36.190 --> 08:37.350
Father had worked

08:38.000 --> 08:40.630
tirelessly for decades, worrying day and night.

08:41.150 --> 08:42.200
However, his health

08:42.320 --> 08:43.770
had been deteriorating day by day.

08:44.670 --> 08:46.100
Fortunately, Dai returned home

08:46.390 --> 08:47.840
and brought back a miraculous pill.

08:48.150 --> 08:49.430
After Father took it,

08:49.510 --> 08:50.790
he went into seclusion.

08:51.150 --> 08:52.390
However, a few days ago,

08:53.080 --> 08:55.200
he died suddenly.

08:56.390 --> 08:57.790
High Priest,

08:58.080 --> 08:58.960
may I ask if that pill

09:00.240 --> 09:02.550
came from your Fangwai Mountain?

09:09.550 --> 09:10.630
I don't know about that.

09:11.240 --> 09:12.270
You don't know?

09:14.750 --> 09:16.720
What about the Elders present?

09:17.320 --> 09:19.000
Don't tell me you don't know either!

09:22.790 --> 09:23.670
Several months ago,

09:24.070 --> 09:25.550
someone did sneak into our mountain to steal medicine.

09:25.670 --> 09:27.630
After investigation, we found that the thief

09:27.650 --> 09:29.370
was the eldest daughter of the old City Lord,

09:29.440 --> 09:31.910
that is, Young Mistress Dai here.

09:32.200 --> 09:33.870
Previously, Young Mistress Dai

09:33.870 --> 09:35.600
had humbly served as a maid in our Fangwai Mountain

09:35.620 --> 09:36.860
for over 10 years.

09:37.200 --> 09:38.000
At that time,

09:38.100 --> 09:39.950
we didn't know her identity.

09:40.400 --> 09:41.640
Later, after she stole the miraculous pill,

09:41.670 --> 09:42.960
our clan sent someone to investigate.

09:43.270 --> 09:44.870
That's when we learned about her background.

09:45.440 --> 09:46.240
Actually,

09:47.030 --> 09:49.030
our clan has always been on good terms with Yandu.

09:49.240 --> 09:51.550
If she had revealed her identity and asked for it directly,

09:52.030 --> 09:53.600
our clan wouldn't have been stingy, either.

09:53.870 --> 09:55.550
So for our clan,

09:55.570 --> 09:57.000
this isn't a big deal.

09:57.150 --> 09:59.820
And we have absolutely no intention of holding her accountable.

10:00.150 --> 10:01.440
Her actions were out of filial piety.

10:01.910 --> 10:03.550
Consider that pill as our gift to her.

10:03.880 --> 10:05.790
The Youhu Clan is indeed merciful.

10:06.260 --> 10:07.930
Then I dare to ask another question.

10:08.680 --> 10:10.290
What effects can be expected

10:10.720 --> 10:12.270
after taking this pill?

10:13.440 --> 10:14.240
What?

10:14.960 --> 10:16.440
Do you suspect that

10:17.240 --> 10:18.440
the pill was poison?

10:19.790 --> 10:20.600
I wouldn't dare.

10:22.110 --> 10:23.630
This pill was forged from

10:23.650 --> 10:24.720
the divine blood of our High Priest.

10:24.840 --> 10:26.720
It has the effect of prolonging life.

10:26.850 --> 10:27.880
Given your father's constitution,

10:27.910 --> 10:28.960
taking this pill

10:29.230 --> 10:31.300
should have added at least 30 to 50 years to his life.

10:32.340 --> 10:33.590
30 to 50 years?

10:34.260 --> 10:36.190
What a bold claim, 30 to 50 years.

10:37.270 --> 10:39.670
Then where are my father's 30 to 50 years!

10:40.320 --> 10:41.550
How come after taking the pill,

10:41.550 --> 10:42.840
he suddenly died?

10:42.860 --> 10:44.340
It was you who killed Father.

10:48.200 --> 10:49.050
High Priest.

10:52.580 --> 10:54.620
She said I killed my father.

10:56.030 --> 10:57.200
Do you agree?

10:57.440 --> 10:59.050
Don't you feel guilty?

11:18.600 --> 11:19.390
Tanyin.

11:20.600 --> 11:21.840
I bought some sweet soup.

11:22.120 --> 11:23.270
It's really delicious.

11:23.440 --> 11:24.670
Come on, have a taste.

11:25.510 --> 11:27.000
I'm a bit worried about Yuanzhong.

11:27.550 --> 11:29.150
I want to go to the City Lord's Mansion to check on him.

11:30.150 --> 11:31.390
Drink the soup first.

11:31.480 --> 11:32.790
I'll take you there in a while.

11:52.960 --> 11:54.360
Do you find all this

11:54.360 --> 11:55.360
very amusing, High Priest?

11:56.200 --> 11:57.630
I just have a feeling that this scene

11:58.530 --> 12:00.010
is somewhat familiar.

12:00.590 --> 12:02.640
High Priest, you possess the demigod power

12:02.660 --> 12:03.950
and have seen all the trials and tribulations of this world.

12:04.120 --> 12:05.150
The life or death of a mere human

12:05.150 --> 12:06.310
city lord

12:06.400 --> 12:07.960
is probably nothing unusual for you.

12:08.200 --> 12:09.550
But for me

12:09.570 --> 12:11.500
and the citizens of Yandu,

12:12.030 --> 12:13.960
this matter is heartbreaking

12:14.270 --> 12:15.620
and deeply painful.

12:16.270 --> 12:17.240
You suspect

12:17.690 --> 12:19.780
that I killed the old City Lord?

12:20.320 --> 12:21.480
There's no need to suspect.

12:22.790 --> 12:24.030
I'm certain.

12:24.050 --> 12:24.630
You...

12:26.000 --> 12:27.150
How could this be?

12:27.480 --> 12:28.080
The High Priest...

12:28.080 --> 12:29.240
He can't make such reckless accusations.

12:30.360 --> 12:32.030
You're framing and slandering him.

12:32.240 --> 12:34.150
It was you who established the Wushuang Society,

12:34.170 --> 12:35.480
colluded with the War Demons,

12:35.800 --> 12:36.800
and after being exposed,

12:36.830 --> 12:38.080
killed your father and harmed your sister.

12:38.440 --> 12:40.120
Now you even dare to shift the blame onto someone else.

12:40.570 --> 12:41.440
If you really have doubts

12:41.440 --> 12:42.790
about the old City Lord's sudden death,

12:43.000 --> 12:44.360
why are you so eager to hold the funeral?

12:44.960 --> 12:46.600
And why did you drug your sister

12:46.620 --> 12:47.950
and have her escorted out of the city?

12:48.240 --> 12:49.240
That's because I didn't want her

12:49.240 --> 12:50.200
to be involved anymore

12:50.240 --> 12:52.240
and continue to be exploited by your despicable schemes!

12:52.270 --> 12:53.510
You're still making excuses.

12:53.600 --> 12:54.390
Tanghua.

12:54.750 --> 12:55.670
He has already

12:55.670 --> 12:56.750
said so much.

12:57.200 --> 12:58.520
If you don't let him finish,

12:59.240 --> 13:01.280
it'll make us look guilty instead.

13:08.910 --> 13:09.750
Young City Lord.

13:10.510 --> 13:12.750
The old City Lord is no longer with us.

13:13.750 --> 13:16.030
You should know what it means

13:16.480 --> 13:17.910
to say such things

13:18.120 --> 13:19.430
in your position, right?

13:20.450 --> 13:21.760
Of course I know.

13:21.840 --> 13:23.910
I'm not only the Young City Lord of Yandu,

13:24.390 --> 13:26.480
but also my father's son.

13:27.220 --> 13:28.500
Who wouldn't want to

13:28.970 --> 13:30.790
avenge their father's death on the murderer?

13:31.990 --> 13:33.990
I'll never rest until you're dead!

13:37.280 --> 13:38.160
Absurd.

13:38.320 --> 13:39.120
Alright then.

13:39.620 --> 13:41.040
I'll say something that's not absurd.

13:41.600 --> 13:43.670
Back then in Pinghu, High Priest Yuanzhong

13:43.770 --> 13:46.080
single-handedly quelled the war.

13:46.600 --> 13:47.690
To show gratitude for

13:47.720 --> 13:49.030
the High Priest,

13:49.630 --> 13:52.120
our race has been extremely respectful and obedient over the years,

13:52.550 --> 13:54.000
sparing no effort or resources

13:54.000 --> 13:55.120
to serve him.

13:56.030 --> 13:57.550
But how has the High Priest

13:57.550 --> 13:58.790
treated us in return?

13:59.600 --> 14:00.870
Over the past 60 years,

14:01.320 --> 14:02.750
whenever our human race encountered

14:02.770 --> 14:04.890
natural or man-made disasters beyond our control,

14:05.510 --> 14:07.790
we'd beseech Liujiao Palace.

14:08.390 --> 14:11.440
But when did the High Priest ever help us?

14:12.080 --> 14:13.550
Not even once!

14:13.550 --> 14:14.270
That's because...

14:14.270 --> 14:15.870
Doesn't he claim to be a god?

14:16.070 --> 14:17.240
Gods receive worship and offerings.

14:17.300 --> 14:19.570
Aren't they supposed to protect all living beings?

14:22.550 --> 14:23.480
Besides, recently,

14:24.600 --> 14:26.440
he came down from Fangwai Mountain.

14:27.390 --> 14:28.480
Along the way,

14:29.160 --> 14:30.520
tower ships capsized,

14:31.120 --> 14:33.790
and passengers suffered heavy casualties.

14:33.960 --> 14:34.960
Even remote places

14:34.960 --> 14:36.510
like the Orange Lake

14:37.000 --> 14:38.790
have reignited with the flames of war.

14:39.720 --> 14:42.080
Who knows how many of our human civilians

14:42.260 --> 14:44.200
died in the conflict between you

14:44.220 --> 14:45.490
and the War Demons?

14:45.790 --> 14:47.160
As soon as you arrived in Yandu,

14:47.800 --> 14:49.640
my father died.

14:52.840 --> 14:53.870
Is all of this

14:54.200 --> 14:55.870
just a coincidence?

14:56.150 --> 14:57.480
Nonsense!

14:57.630 --> 14:59.440
I think you've truly lost your mind.

14:59.480 --> 15:00.550
Recklessly making accusations!

15:00.960 --> 15:02.870
Do you really think our Youhu Clan is defenseless?

15:03.050 --> 15:04.600
The Youhu Clan will not tolerate insults.

15:04.750 --> 15:05.550
Today,

15:05.690 --> 15:07.730
you must give our clan an explanation!

15:07.910 --> 15:08.720
Zhi Yue.

15:08.980 --> 15:11.340
You colluded with the War Demons, killed your father, and harmed your sister.

15:12.140 --> 15:13.900
We only came to pay respects to your father first

15:14.270 --> 15:16.200
out of consideration for the human race's reputation.

15:16.360 --> 15:17.640
Just because we showed courtesy

15:17.960 --> 15:19.120
doesn't mean we'll let you take advantage

15:19.140 --> 15:20.430
and make baseless accusations and insults.

15:20.750 --> 15:22.030
If you continue to spout nonsense,

15:22.360 --> 15:24.030
just think of what happened to the War Demons

15:24.030 --> 15:25.360
in the battle of Pinghu!

15:25.440 --> 15:26.250
Hold on.

15:32.150 --> 15:32.960
Dingxu?

15:33.360 --> 15:34.240
Young City Lord

15:34.630 --> 15:35.670
and everyone. How are you?

15:35.870 --> 15:37.200
I, Dingxu, pay my respects.

15:38.750 --> 15:39.680
Why are you here?

15:40.670 --> 15:41.480
Tanghua.

15:42.240 --> 15:43.670
Where I am is not important.

15:43.960 --> 15:44.750
Now,

15:45.200 --> 15:47.030
we're questioning the High Priest, aren't we?

15:47.960 --> 15:48.750
High Priest.

15:49.380 --> 15:50.290
Hostility between the two clans

15:50.320 --> 15:51.650
benefits no one.

15:52.080 --> 15:53.240
As for the rights and wrongs,

15:54.240 --> 15:55.030
why don't you

15:55.240 --> 15:56.750
let me, as a mediator,

15:57.480 --> 15:58.720
ask a couple of questions?

16:00.570 --> 16:01.780
What do you want to ask?

16:02.840 --> 16:03.870
I want to ask,

16:04.210 --> 16:05.330
High Priest, have you

16:05.360 --> 16:06.870
given up on your thought of

16:07.000 --> 16:08.110
bringing divine punishment

16:08.130 --> 16:09.730
and destroying the Mortal Realm

16:10.030 --> 16:11.120
by the power of the Divine Left Hand?

16:50.960 --> 16:51.750
You're awake.

16:52.840 --> 16:53.670
Who are you?

16:59.630 --> 17:00.840
I'm the teacher

17:00.870 --> 17:02.200
of the City Lord of Yandu.

17:02.630 --> 17:05.310
Everyone calls me Master Yan.

17:06.880 --> 17:08.069
Why am I here?

17:08.430 --> 17:10.160
I invited you here.

17:11.480 --> 17:13.200
You used Xue to poison me?

17:13.950 --> 17:15.589
Poison alone wouldn't have been enough.

17:15.829 --> 17:17.960
I had to use some other tricks as well.

17:18.349 --> 17:19.829
After all, you are a god.

17:20.160 --> 17:21.640
I had to be cautious.

17:22.400 --> 17:23.310
Don't be surprised.

17:24.440 --> 17:25.550
Your identity is no secret

17:25.550 --> 17:26.720
to me.

17:27.030 --> 17:28.030
I have no intention of harming you.

17:28.050 --> 17:29.900
I just wanted to have you here as a guest.

17:30.100 --> 17:31.290
When the time comes,

17:31.680 --> 17:33.480
I'll certainly let you go.

17:33.880 --> 17:34.960
What do you want?

17:51.640 --> 17:52.440
Dingxu.

17:52.940 --> 17:54.770
What... What are you talking about?

17:56.720 --> 17:57.510
Dingxu.

17:58.350 --> 17:59.960
You just won't give up, will you?

18:00.620 --> 18:02.140
What trick have you come up with this time?

18:05.350 --> 18:06.200
Young City Lord.

18:06.510 --> 18:08.000
I may not be able to answer other questions,

18:08.030 --> 18:09.000
but there is one thing that

18:09.030 --> 18:11.270
truly has nothing to do with our High Priest.

18:11.510 --> 18:12.790
You said that over the past 60 years,

18:12.830 --> 18:14.640
the High Priest has never responded

18:14.640 --> 18:15.720
to your prayers

18:15.750 --> 18:17.310
and never protected you.

18:17.750 --> 18:18.830
That wasn't his fault.

18:19.270 --> 18:20.960
It was because after the battle of Pinghu,

18:21.120 --> 18:22.970
his spiritual heart became unstable due to too much killing,

18:23.000 --> 18:24.400
showing signs of falling into demonic ways!

18:25.680 --> 18:28.110
After that, to stabilize his spiritual heart

18:28.290 --> 18:29.660
and achieve godhood,

18:29.720 --> 18:31.750
he secluded himself for 40 years, not concerning himself with outside affairs.

18:31.960 --> 18:33.070
He only emerged from seclusion

18:33.070 --> 18:33.920
after he felt

18:33.920 --> 18:35.350
his cultivation was complete.

18:36.200 --> 18:37.070
Unfortunately,

18:37.400 --> 18:39.030
we were all deceived by him.

18:39.440 --> 18:41.270
Not only did he fail to achieve the body of a demigod,

18:41.270 --> 18:42.790
but he fell even deeper into the demonic ways!

18:42.790 --> 18:43.550
Dingxu!

18:43.830 --> 18:45.030
What are you trying to do now?

18:46.310 --> 18:47.160
These past few days,

18:47.880 --> 18:49.310
I learned he's come to Yandu

18:49.310 --> 18:50.510
and sensed something was wrong.

18:50.880 --> 18:52.310
So I sent someone to follow him.

18:52.510 --> 18:53.310
Soon,

18:53.510 --> 18:54.480
I discovered

18:54.480 --> 18:55.790
a terrifying truth.

18:59.880 --> 19:00.720
He harbors hatred.

19:01.550 --> 19:02.790
He hates the human race,

19:03.200 --> 19:04.400
hates the War Demons,

19:04.550 --> 19:05.750
and he hates us, too!

19:06.110 --> 19:07.310
He has been consumed by malice,

19:07.310 --> 19:08.640
harboring thoughts of destroying the world!

19:09.000 --> 19:09.480
This...

19:11.480 --> 19:12.510
This is impossible.

19:13.170 --> 19:14.440
Do you all remember

19:14.640 --> 19:16.400
the recent unusual celestial phenomenon?

19:16.440 --> 19:17.680
It was clearly in the middle of the night,

19:17.700 --> 19:19.330
yet suddenly, the sky became bright as day.

19:24.510 --> 19:25.830
It was his doing.

19:26.440 --> 19:27.680
He traveled far and wide,

19:27.680 --> 19:28.440
unlocking one by one

19:28.440 --> 19:29.920
the five weapon spirits of the Divine Hand.

19:29.920 --> 19:30.720
And he ordered them

19:30.720 --> 19:32.030
to go to the Five Extremities,

19:32.150 --> 19:33.750
while he himself came to Yandu,

19:33.880 --> 19:35.550
intending to use the Divine Hand as a starter,

19:35.590 --> 19:36.920
exploit the powers/might of earth and heaven

19:36.920 --> 19:37.680
to enact divine punishment,

19:37.680 --> 19:38.830
and destroy all the living beings he deems guilty

19:38.830 --> 19:40.480
in this world!

19:41.160 --> 19:42.160
When the time comes,

19:42.680 --> 19:44.270
thunderbolts will level mountains,

19:44.690 --> 19:45.930
underground fires will scorch wastelands,

19:45.960 --> 19:47.480
floods will submerge towns,

19:47.550 --> 19:48.510
and everything in this world

19:48.510 --> 19:50.070
will cease to exist!

19:50.400 --> 19:52.200
You... You're talking nonsense!

19:53.550 --> 19:55.070
Whether it's true or not, he's right here.

19:55.070 --> 19:55.830
Ask him yourself!

19:56.630 --> 19:58.600
Yuanzhong, he's spouting nonsense,

19:58.620 --> 20:00.380
and none of this is true, right?

20:02.640 --> 20:03.440
Dingxu.

20:04.550 --> 20:06.200
You're truly shameless.

20:09.720 --> 20:11.070
Did I say anything wrong?

20:12.350 --> 20:13.960
Isn't this what you planned?

20:14.310 --> 20:15.350
Isn't this what you

20:15.350 --> 20:16.400
told me yourself?

20:17.200 --> 20:18.510
Are you going to deny it?

20:22.160 --> 20:23.270
Young City Lord Zhi Yue.

20:24.310 --> 20:25.790
I don't know if he really is

20:25.790 --> 20:27.440
the one who killed your father,

20:28.400 --> 20:29.310
or even what

20:29.310 --> 20:30.400
that Wushuang Chamber of Commerce

20:30.400 --> 20:31.440
you established does

20:31.480 --> 20:32.920
and whether it has colluded with the War Demons.

20:32.920 --> 20:34.210
None of this matters anymore.

20:34.640 --> 20:35.750
He is a demon spawn

20:36.010 --> 20:36.970
with the intent to destroy the world.

20:37.000 --> 20:38.790
No one in this world will survive!

20:39.240 --> 20:40.160
Leaving the Divine Hand

20:40.160 --> 20:41.310
in the hands of such a person

20:41.330 --> 20:42.850
is our sin!

20:44.240 --> 20:45.240
Heaven-Turning Seal!

20:48.830 --> 20:50.000
High Priest.

20:50.200 --> 20:51.750
Since you've fallen into demonic ways,

20:51.830 --> 20:53.640
anyone has the right to eliminate you.

20:54.030 --> 20:55.680
Today, even if it means mutual destruction,

20:55.680 --> 20:57.750
you won't leave here alive!

20:58.270 --> 20:59.400
Members of the Youhu Clan,

20:59.590 --> 21:00.920
have you still not come to your senses?

21:00.940 --> 21:03.010
Do you all intend to fall into demonic ways?

21:08.510 --> 21:09.720
All commanders, heed my order!

21:09.880 --> 21:11.440
Slay the evil demon!

21:34.070 --> 21:35.960
I never expected that

21:36.920 --> 21:38.640
after 60 years,

21:39.030 --> 21:41.000
I would still witness this scene.

21:42.750 --> 21:44.680
It's truly nostalgic.

21:45.680 --> 21:46.750
Old scoundrel Dingxu.

21:47.240 --> 21:49.400
You've really gone to great lengths

21:50.270 --> 21:52.240
to extend your miserable life.

21:52.730 --> 21:54.340
I underestimated you.

21:56.480 --> 21:57.270
Indeed,

21:58.830 --> 22:00.830
I once had the thought of destroying the world,

22:01.590 --> 22:02.640
but someone has

22:02.690 --> 22:04.490
made me abandon that thought.

22:04.960 --> 22:05.750
What?

22:06.720 --> 22:07.510
Do I need to be punished

22:07.510 --> 22:09.270
for a thought

22:09.680 --> 22:11.310
I once had?

22:11.550 --> 22:14.110
Thoughts can change in an instant.

22:14.440 --> 22:16.880
What if you change your mind, High Priest?

22:17.400 --> 22:18.240
Do you expect us

22:18.240 --> 22:19.750
to entrust the fate of the world

22:19.770 --> 22:20.730
to your

22:20.760 --> 22:22.690
whims and fancies?

22:23.480 --> 22:25.640
You, with a demon's heart, wield the power of god alone.

22:25.680 --> 22:27.880
A single thought from you can determine life and death for all.

22:27.900 --> 22:29.420
That's why you can't live!

22:30.110 --> 22:31.160
Accept your fate.

22:31.720 --> 22:33.550
This is your original sin.

22:35.440 --> 22:36.240
Old scoundrel.

22:37.880 --> 22:39.800
You've finally said it.

22:40.960 --> 22:43.200
I've already spared your lives,

22:43.590 --> 22:45.830
yet you failed to appreciate it.

22:46.770 --> 22:49.810
Don't blame me for being merciless then.

22:51.110 --> 22:54.000
Sixty years ago, I managed to slaughter my way through Pinghu.

22:54.630 --> 22:58.390
Today, I can just as well massacre Yandu.

23:04.030 --> 23:04.830
Yuanzhong...

23:08.510 --> 23:09.310
Attack!

23:24.700 --> 23:26.510
Jiuguang, take Zhi Dai and leave here first!

23:26.530 --> 23:27.210
Got it!

23:28.060 --> 23:28.700
Let's go.

24:00.160 --> 24:00.960
Baili Xiang.

24:01.170 --> 24:02.070
He's fallen into demonic ways.

24:02.100 --> 24:03.430
It's not too late for you to turn back now.

24:03.510 --> 24:05.440
That's right! Don't be stubborn and deluded!

24:05.440 --> 24:06.510
You two old fools.

24:06.510 --> 24:07.590
You believe everything you hear!

24:07.590 --> 24:08.720
Internal strife is one thing.

24:08.720 --> 24:10.510
How can you betray the High Priest in public?

24:22.790 --> 24:24.480
Tanghua, escort them to leave first.

25:05.870 --> 25:06.750
Grand Elder.

25:10.510 --> 25:11.360
Grand Elder.

25:12.070 --> 25:13.750
You've come to Yandu but haven't shown yourself.

25:13.750 --> 25:16.790
What's the intention of all this hiding?

25:19.680 --> 25:20.680
There's something

25:22.480 --> 25:23.720
I need your help with.

25:24.030 --> 25:24.830
What is it?

25:25.270 --> 25:26.680
You'll know when you see it.

25:41.440 --> 25:42.230
Yuanzhong!

25:45.160 --> 25:45.850
Let's go!

26:13.290 --> 26:14.850
You came quite fast.

26:15.790 --> 26:18.270
He risked his life to follow you,

26:18.820 --> 26:20.650
yet this is how he ended up.

26:21.680 --> 26:23.680
Wasn't Baili Xiang killed by you?

26:24.200 --> 26:25.910
I've treated him well in this life,

26:26.030 --> 26:27.750
guiding him at every turn, teaching him at all times.

26:28.030 --> 26:29.480
I can say I've done right by him.

26:31.040 --> 26:32.300
The road to the underworld is long.

26:32.990 --> 26:34.880
What if he gets lost again?

26:35.480 --> 26:36.270
Why don't

26:37.070 --> 26:39.000
you go guide him one last time?

26:46.790 --> 26:47.590
Guards!

26:51.330 --> 26:52.680
Yuanzhong, leave here first.

26:53.400 --> 26:54.480
Think of Ji Tanyin.

26:54.590 --> 26:55.440
They won't just go after

26:55.440 --> 26:56.270
you alone.

26:57.680 --> 26:58.590
Hurry up and leave!

26:59.510 --> 27:00.310
Be careful.

27:18.680 --> 27:21.110
I never thought that

27:21.790 --> 27:23.510
I would see a god again in my lifetime.

27:24.530 --> 27:25.310
I originally thought

27:25.310 --> 27:26.960
Zhi Yue was radical.

27:27.180 --> 27:28.660
I thought since the time wasn't right,

27:29.160 --> 27:30.750
our human race shouldn't have

27:30.750 --> 27:32.030
revealed ourselves so early.

27:32.920 --> 27:34.120
But I didn't expect

27:37.890 --> 27:40.090
Zhi Yue would go this far.

27:47.030 --> 27:48.030
What is this?

27:48.400 --> 27:50.720
It's called the Primordial God-Binding Net,

27:51.400 --> 27:52.790
a magical artifact specifically designed

27:52.790 --> 27:54.070
to imprison gods.

27:54.440 --> 27:56.270
I don't like this name.

27:57.000 --> 27:58.440
If I had created it,

27:58.680 --> 28:00.510
I would have named it the Formless Circle.

28:01.270 --> 28:02.070
Look.

28:02.510 --> 28:04.030
It's a thunder-based magical artifact,

28:04.160 --> 28:06.180
refined from the purple thunder of the North Sea.

28:06.200 --> 28:08.370
It can be big or small, formless and shapeless.

28:08.640 --> 28:09.990
It has no power on its own,

28:10.160 --> 28:11.480
but with you inside,

28:11.480 --> 28:13.480
you've become the magic source of this magical artifact.

28:14.750 --> 28:17.030
Everything in nature has its own strengths and weaknesses.

28:17.030 --> 28:18.680
Even gods cannot

28:18.680 --> 28:19.960
be completely fearless.

28:21.210 --> 28:23.100
Just like this magical artifact.

28:30.240 --> 28:31.680
Although it's harmless to humans,

28:32.070 --> 28:34.510
it's a powerful tool for imprisoning gods.

28:34.710 --> 28:36.880
Using gods' power to imprison gods,

28:37.920 --> 28:39.440
isn't that amazing?

28:39.550 --> 28:40.400
How did you obtain

28:40.400 --> 28:41.440
this magical artifact?

28:43.920 --> 28:44.920
Who gave it to you?

28:45.960 --> 28:47.960
Since you already know the answer,

28:47.980 --> 28:49.500
why bother asking me?

28:50.440 --> 28:52.750
So even gods also fight for power and profit,

28:52.830 --> 28:54.150
and scheme against each other.

28:55.400 --> 28:56.270
In this aspect,

28:56.410 --> 28:58.650
you're not much better than those in the Mortal Realm.

28:59.160 --> 28:59.960
Why are you

28:59.960 --> 29:00.830
keeping me here?

29:01.070 --> 29:02.440
What exactly do you want to do?

29:02.820 --> 29:04.380
I might as well tell you.

29:05.310 --> 29:06.550
We made a deal with

29:06.550 --> 29:08.440
a god from your Divine Realm.

29:08.460 --> 29:09.510
We'll help her kill

29:09.510 --> 29:11.260
Yuanzhong, the High Priest of the Youhu Clan,

29:11.400 --> 29:13.640
and in return, she'll allow War Demons to return to the Divine Realm

29:13.640 --> 29:15.160
and never set foot in the Mortal Realm again.

29:15.350 --> 29:16.270
Without War Demons

29:16.270 --> 29:17.720
and the High Priest,

29:17.890 --> 29:19.200
how could those members of the Youhu Clan,

29:19.200 --> 29:20.270
who are unproductive,

29:20.290 --> 29:22.380
gluttonous, lazy, and stupid,

29:22.520 --> 29:23.910
possibly withstand

29:24.340 --> 29:26.650
the army of craftsmen from our human race?

29:27.160 --> 29:28.240
Moreover, I've obtained

29:28.240 --> 29:29.790
what I wanted for myself.

29:31.010 --> 29:32.350
In 100 years,

29:33.720 --> 29:35.270
perhaps even sooner,

29:36.200 --> 29:37.350
in this world,

29:38.190 --> 29:40.080
there will be no more immortal sects.

29:40.930 --> 29:44.280
Only the grand momentum of the human race will remain.

29:51.190 --> 29:52.360
What's your name?

29:52.960 --> 29:54.200
What's your position among gods?

29:54.640 --> 29:56.070
Why did you come to the Mortal Realm?

29:56.350 --> 29:57.830
And why have you been with

29:57.830 --> 29:59.240
the High Priest of the Youhu Clan,

29:59.350 --> 30:00.830
acting as his handmaiden

30:01.210 --> 30:02.340
with the identity of a god?

30:04.640 --> 30:06.140
The Mortal Realm hasn't been

30:06.160 --> 30:08.030
visited by gods for hundreds of years.

30:08.310 --> 30:09.240
I thought gods

30:09.240 --> 30:10.790
no longer existed.

30:11.170 --> 30:12.850
Wasn't the celestial ladder broken?

30:13.250 --> 30:14.650
How did you come here?

30:15.440 --> 30:17.160
Were you born into the divine race,

30:17.270 --> 30:19.080
or did you ascend through personal cultivation

30:19.220 --> 30:20.830
to become a god?

30:23.790 --> 30:25.480
You are nice to Yuanzhong.

30:26.480 --> 30:28.920
Could it be that you were once a member of the Youhu Clan?

30:31.750 --> 30:33.280
Don't waste your efforts.

30:33.880 --> 30:35.480
You won't be able to get out.

30:35.790 --> 30:37.440
Why don't you talk to me instead?

30:40.240 --> 30:41.440
Let me out.

30:42.240 --> 30:44.750
Are all of you from the divine race like this?

30:45.030 --> 30:46.510
Possessing divine power

30:46.510 --> 30:47.790
but lacking intelligence.

30:48.110 --> 30:50.030
No wonder you were so badly beaten by the demon clan.

30:50.030 --> 30:51.160
Let me out!

30:51.270 --> 30:52.510
That's why the management of the Six Realms

30:52.920 --> 30:55.000
should have been handed over to us humans long ago.

30:55.680 --> 30:57.240
If we had such long lifespans

30:57.240 --> 30:58.510
and such strong power,

30:58.640 --> 31:00.880
how could we have been taken advantage of by a few demons?

31:01.350 --> 31:03.000
Look at this mess of a world!

31:03.200 --> 31:05.000
This is all the sin of your divine race!

31:05.000 --> 31:05.480
What exactly

31:05.480 --> 31:06.830
do you intend to do to Yuanzhong?

31:07.510 --> 31:09.790
I'm telling you, you can't!

31:10.110 --> 31:11.000
I won't allow it!

31:11.000 --> 31:12.960
What can you do if you don't allow it?

31:13.400 --> 31:14.590
If I wish,

31:14.680 --> 31:16.000
you will never be able to leave

31:16.000 --> 31:16.960
this room.

31:16.980 --> 31:18.950
Even if he's chopped into mincemeat,

31:19.680 --> 31:20.960
what can you do?

31:28.930 --> 31:30.450
All creatures are born from the primordial power.

31:31.270 --> 31:32.800
All beings are equal.

31:34.590 --> 31:36.590
Although we humans are weak,

31:37.830 --> 31:39.220
we are intelligent.

31:40.110 --> 31:41.750
We are good at innovation

31:42.000 --> 31:43.330
and endurance.

31:43.720 --> 31:45.680
We endure diseases, coldness,

31:45.680 --> 31:47.880
loneliness, and disasters.

31:48.590 --> 31:50.350
We are like wild grass,

31:50.880 --> 31:52.110
not to be dispersed by the wind,

31:52.350 --> 31:53.590
and not to be extinguished by fire.

31:55.200 --> 31:56.790
But once we have a chance,

31:56.790 --> 31:59.070
we will spread across the entire land!

32:00.400 --> 32:01.590
But what about you?

32:03.720 --> 32:04.590
Foolish,

32:05.310 --> 32:06.200
arrogant,

32:06.480 --> 32:07.350
and obsessed!

32:08.030 --> 32:09.510
You're so worried and anxious.

32:09.880 --> 32:10.960
Don't tell me you've fallen in love with

32:10.960 --> 32:13.350
that High Priest of the Youhu Clan.

32:14.720 --> 32:16.680
As expected from a god.

32:17.130 --> 32:18.770
Full of compassion,

32:19.480 --> 32:20.720
letting emotions cloud your judgment!

32:20.720 --> 32:21.640
Shut up!

33:00.030 --> 33:01.000
High Priest.

33:01.790 --> 33:03.070
We meet again.

33:04.400 --> 33:05.960
What a coincidence.

33:06.590 --> 33:07.400
You

33:07.990 --> 33:09.510
are not what you used to be.

33:10.350 --> 33:12.350
This is all thanks to you, High Priest.

33:14.200 --> 33:15.280
You're injured?

33:15.550 --> 33:16.790
Likewise.

33:17.550 --> 33:19.550
I should also thank you for that.

34:22.560 --> 34:23.889
The Perfect War Demon's power

34:24.320 --> 34:25.760
is nothing special after all.

34:27.300 --> 34:28.900
Drain his blood first.

34:29.110 --> 34:30.920
Then we can cut off his Divine Hand

34:31.110 --> 34:31.940
and kill him.

34:32.350 --> 34:33.150
Form the formation!

35:07.930 --> 35:09.890
All mortals, heed my command.

35:21.480 --> 35:22.560
It's God. It's God.

35:22.580 --> 35:23.500
God has manifested.

35:27.670 --> 35:29.880
Yuanzhong, the High Priest of the Youhu Clan,

35:30.210 --> 35:31.610
has fallen into demonic ways.

35:31.880 --> 35:33.400
He harbors the thought of destroying the world,

35:33.430 --> 35:35.060
and is an enemy of all living beings.

35:35.620 --> 35:37.580
Whoever slays this demon,

35:37.760 --> 35:39.200
even if they perish,

35:39.510 --> 35:42.150
their divine soul will be protected by all gods

35:42.150 --> 35:43.590
and be guided to the Heavenly Realm,

35:43.960 --> 35:45.630
enjoying infinite blessings

35:45.920 --> 35:47.550
for tens of thousands of years.

35:48.350 --> 35:49.270
It's Hannv.

35:49.680 --> 35:50.550
It's Hannv.

35:52.510 --> 35:53.630
Yuanzhong is in danger.

36:10.190 --> 36:11.230
Why?

36:30.890 --> 36:31.690
Qian Lin?

36:32.180 --> 36:33.970
Call me Qian Lin, the Perfect War Demon.

36:34.160 --> 36:36.930
♫The flowing water does not compete for the lead♫

36:37.020 --> 36:37.910
No way.

36:37.480 --> 36:40.850
♫For millennia, all will turn to dust♫

36:38.920 --> 36:40.960
You couldn't possibly have become the Perfect War Demon.

36:41.320 --> 36:44.100
♫With our feet on the earth and the sky above♫

36:41.510 --> 36:43.320
You think there's only one way

36:43.320 --> 36:44.760
to create the Perfect War Demon?

36:44.330 --> 36:47.860
♫We, the heroes of our time, are no ordinary beings♫

36:46.880 --> 36:49.150
Yuanzhong, I've figured it out.

36:47.880 --> 36:50.680
♫The flowing water does not compete for the lead♫

36:49.800 --> 36:51.230
The elephant has been bound by the rope

36:50.940 --> 36:54.280
♫In my heart, there are no ripples, as if a god resides within♫

36:51.230 --> 36:52.070
from a young age.

36:52.400 --> 36:53.400
Since it couldn't break free back then,

36:53.400 --> 36:54.880
it believed it could never break free.

36:54.900 --> 36:57.780
♫I ride the wind and embrace the moon♫

36:55.280 --> 36:56.880
It submitted to that rope.

36:57.440 --> 36:58.280
So did I.

36:57.880 --> 37:01.280
♫The raging river in my dreams has never ceased♫

36:58.710 --> 36:59.460
My hatred

36:59.480 --> 37:01.410
is the rope that binds me.

37:01.300 --> 37:03.130
♫The flowing water does not compete for the lead, and I want to be like the flowing rivers, lakes, and seas♫

37:02.420 --> 37:03.450
Why are you here?

37:03.150 --> 37:04.700
♫The flowing water does not compete for the lead, vast and surging♫

37:04.000 --> 37:04.920
Where's Ji Tanyin?

37:04.720 --> 37:06.420
♫In my heart, there are no ripples, love, hatred, gratitude, or grudges, as if a god resides within♫

37:05.110 --> 37:06.190
We were set up.

37:06.450 --> 37:08.080
♫In my heart, there are no ripples, as if a god resides within, while disputes and entanglements repeated countless times♫

37:06.550 --> 37:08.190
When I woke up, she was already gone.

37:08.320 --> 37:10.100
♫I ride the wind and embrace the moon, and I want to conquer the world without struggle♫

37:08.670 --> 37:09.440
Yuanzhong,

37:09.440 --> 37:10.800
I'll hold these people off for you.

37:10.130 --> 37:11.310
♫I ride the wind and embrace the moon, just like water that nothing can fight♫

37:10.800 --> 37:11.670
You go save her.

37:11.340 --> 37:13.110
♫The raging river in my dreams has never ceased, able to take on and let go, neither arrogant nor impatient♫

37:13.130 --> 37:15.790
♫The raging river in my dreams has never ceased, only a steady stream can be considered humble♫

37:24.550 --> 37:25.630
It's useless.

37:26.030 --> 37:27.230
You can't possibly get out.

37:27.710 --> 37:29.150
I've told you that

37:29.550 --> 37:30.230
this is a magical artifact

37:30.230 --> 37:31.800
from your Divine Realm,

37:32.000 --> 37:33.030
specifically designed to restrain

37:33.030 --> 37:34.670
you gods.

37:35.150 --> 37:37.110
You're wasting your energy.

37:39.440 --> 37:40.230
What?

37:42.030 --> 37:43.070
You've given up?

37:58.720 --> 37:59.670
What are you doing?

38:29.370 --> 38:31.000
Kill him! Kill him!

38:44.950 --> 38:45.840
Go home.

38:45.870 --> 38:47.460
It's dangerous here. Leave!

38:47.480 --> 38:49.120
It's dangerous here. Go!

38:49.150 --> 38:50.590
Go home! Go!

38:54.050 --> 38:55.930
Kid, go home!

38:55.960 --> 38:57.370
It's dangerous here. Go!

38:57.660 --> 38:58.450
Go!

39:20.830 --> 39:22.140
I killed him.

39:23.150 --> 39:23.960
God!

39:24.400 --> 39:25.670
I killed him!

39:25.760 --> 39:26.920
I killed the demon!

39:27.480 --> 39:28.960
I'm going to become a god!

39:28.960 --> 39:30.800
By eliminating this demon, I can become a god!

39:30.800 --> 39:31.630
He is a demon!

39:31.630 --> 39:32.880
He wants to kill us!

39:32.880 --> 39:33.760
Kill him!

39:33.780 --> 39:35.250
Kill him! Kill him!

39:35.280 --> 39:37.190
Kill him! Kill him!

39:37.230 --> 39:39.480
Kill him! Kill him!

39:39.590 --> 39:41.840
