39:58.630 --> 40:00.920
Kill him! Kill him!

40:01.360 --> 40:03.760
Kill him! Kill him!

40:03.960 --> 40:06.110
Kill him! Kill him!

40:06.320 --> 40:08.590
Kill him! Kill him!

40:14.400 --> 40:16.630
Kill him! Kill him!

40:27.430 --> 40:28.540
In the battle of Pinghu,

40:28.560 --> 40:30.640
you eliminated countless War Demons.

40:30.800 --> 40:33.110
Your achievements are unparalleled, and your merits  are immeasurable.

40:33.270 --> 40:35.060
We should worship you.

40:35.280 --> 40:36.880
But now, with a great enemy before us,

40:37.110 --> 40:38.800
the mortal realm needs your protection.

40:39.000 --> 40:40.670
I hope you can put aside past grievances

40:40.740 --> 40:42.610
and fulfill your rightful duty,

40:42.800 --> 40:44.360
living up to the divine artifact's choice.

40:44.360 --> 40:46.030
Doesn't he claim to be a god?

40:46.100 --> 40:47.230
Gods receive worship and offerings.

40:47.250 --> 40:49.040
Aren't they supposed to protect and bless all living beings?

40:49.070 --> 40:50.330
You, with a demonic heart,

40:49.980 --> 40:52.430
♫Wind chimes beat with my heart♫

40:50.360 --> 40:51.590
wield the power of god.

40:51.590 --> 40:53.000
This is your original sin.

40:53.070 --> 40:53.960
Do you understand?

40:53.170 --> 40:56.200
♫Harmonizing, can you recognize it?♫

40:53.960 --> 40:56.480
My father said there's something big happening in the city today.

40:56.480 --> 40:58.280
No one is allowed to play on the streets.

40:57.050 --> 40:59.920
♫Fingertips tracing your outline♫

40:58.400 --> 40:59.630
You should go home too.

41:00.390 --> 41:03.120
♫I wish to see through you♫

41:04.330 --> 41:07.470
♫Whether near or far♫

41:07.820 --> 41:11.550
♫We can still gaze upon the same galaxy♫

41:11.920 --> 41:13.670
Kill him! Kill him!

41:12.420 --> 41:18.420
♫Knowing we've never been apart for a moment♫

41:14.080 --> 41:16.000
Yuanzhong, get up!

41:16.220 --> 41:17.510
Ji Tanyin is still waiting for you!

41:17.510 --> 41:18.280
Hurry up and go!

41:18.830 --> 41:21.700
♫If our promise♫

41:21.910 --> 41:25.480
♫Is to share this land and rivers♫

41:26.020 --> 41:29.020
♫If fate leads us astray♫

41:29.170 --> 41:33.370
♫Life and death become our bond♫

41:33.400 --> 41:36.560
♫Storms heal with time♫

41:36.590 --> 41:41.010
♫Memories will shine in the end♫

41:40.440 --> 41:41.440
Yuanzhong, look.

41:41.650 --> 41:46.730
♫That very first heartbeat, I will remember until the last♫

41:41.730 --> 41:43.410
Two flowers have bloomed in the pond.

41:43.920 --> 41:44.720
Yuanzhong.

41:44.950 --> 41:46.590
I will always be with you.

41:50.630 --> 41:52.210
You've extracted your divine bone?

41:54.800 --> 41:56.320
You are Goddess Wushuang?

41:56.320 --> 41:58.000
You look so devout,

41:58.330 --> 41:59.920
yet you don't even recognize your own god.

42:01.480 --> 42:02.520
Being your god

42:02.840 --> 42:04.400
makes me feel ashamed.

42:26.400 --> 42:28.280
Kill him! Kill him!

42:28.280 --> 42:29.280
Kill him! Kill him!

42:29.280 --> 42:31.230
Kill him! Kill him!

42:31.250 --> 42:32.850
Kill him! Kill him!

42:50.580 --> 42:51.550
How dare you?

42:51.570 --> 42:52.900
Why shouldn't I dare?

42:57.170 --> 42:58.690
This thing can only imprison gods.

43:00.840 --> 43:02.150
I'm no longer a god.

43:04.400 --> 43:05.880
You can't trap me.
